{
  "description": "Objects animate at your command. Choose a number of nonmagical objects within range that aren't being worn or carried, aren't fixed to a surface, and aren't Gargantuan. The maximum number is equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; a Medium or smaller target counts as one object, a Large target counts as two, and a Huge target counts as three. Each target becomes a Construct using the Animated Object stat block. At 0 Hit Points, it reverts to its object form, and any remaining damage carries over.",
